Package: elpR2
Type: Package
Title: The Elephant Listening Project File Management
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bobbi J.", "Estabrook", email = "bobbi.estabrook@cornell.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jidapa", "Janpathompong", role = "ctb"))
Maintainer: Bobbi J. Estabrook <bje37@cornell.edu>
Description: Tools for processing and analyzing elephant rumble detector output,
    gunshot detector output, and other detector output in Raven Pro selection tables.
    Functions include selection table restructuring, sound quality checking, 
    detector performance evaluation, and detection summaries for acoustic monitoring data.
